Parent: 1446

## Context
One-time sweep child of 1446; consumes the isolated probe after 1462 lands. This is the separately commissioned one-time sweep, not routine healthchecking.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Freeze an explicit project inventory using scripts/projects.json and known named VN-Power-Scenario; record inventory provenance, known omissions, and unavailable other-host projects without claiming exhaustive discovery.
- [ ] Inspect prerequisites and external-write/service risk before executing; run the isolated probe serially once per eligible project with a stated finite budget. Unsafe, missing-data, inaccessible, or timed-out cases are explicitly unprobed/inconclusive, never pass.
- [ ] Record revision/target/outcome/limitations for each inventory row. Confirmed offenders get tickets only in their own stores through that project's rules; no-store projects are reported to the author. Include the VN-Power-Scenario result.
- [ ] No credential copying, live-data mutation, routine healthcheck, scheduled sweep, or gate integration. Parent closes only after integration review of both children and the explicit coverage limits.
